<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian National Oil half-yr profit down.</title>
<headline>Nigerian National Oil half-yr profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for National Oil to end-June 1996.</p>
<p>		    (In million naira)</p>
<p>				1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		   6,900    vs 7,400</p>
<p>Profit before turnover   681    vs 1,200</p>
<p>Taxation		     218    vs   428</p>
<p>Profit after taxation    463    vs   730</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
